 (text "Pin 5 is VIO on TCAN3403; it is NOT VREF or SHDN. Pin 8 STB is hard low for full-bandwidth RX.\nStandby mode is not used as a silent receive mode. External R303 holds TXD recessive.\nVehicle firmware must use listen-only. Isolated bench ACK testing needs R301 fitted and normal mode.\nCCA receives passively with R301 open; a separate known-good bench node must ACK the transmitter.\nBus ESD device is not proof of vehicle transient compliance. Connector/ground release remains HOLD." (at 20.32 163.83 0)
 (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)
)
 (justify left top)
)
